---
import electronIcon from "../../public/Electron-logo.svg";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
---

<h2>The Majewski Collection App</h2>
<p class='electron-logo'>
  Built with Electron
  <Image
    src={electronIcon}
    alt='Electron JS Logo'
  />
</p>

<section class='content-wrapper'>
  <iframe
    width='560'
    height='315'
    src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/MVMu9VsafyY?si=19tSt4W9DhP-vcN9'
    title='YouTube video player'
    allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share'
    referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin'
    allowfullscreen
  ></iframe>

  <div class='text-wrapper'>
    <p>
      This is the app that I use to interact with my music catalog database.
      This was the one..., the one that I took a moment when it was fully
      functional, sat back and enjoyed the fruits of my labor for all the time I
      spent learning how to write code.
    </p>
    <p>
      For now this is just a silly little teaser video. I am now in the process
      of storyboarding and getting ready to record the walkthrough demo video.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  h2 {
    margin-block-end: 1lh;
  }

  .electron-logo {
    padding-inline-start: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;

    img {
      width: 2rem;
      height: 2rem;
    }
  }

  .content-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;

    .text-wrapper {
      flex: 1;
      display: grid;
      gap: 1lh;
      max-width: 47ch;
      margin-inline: auto;
    }
  }
</style>
